  "recipe": {
    "positive": "Art Nouveau decorative-poster technique (Alphonse Mucha tradition): sinuous whiplash curves, long flowing contour lines in dark brown, flat soft colour plates with delicate gradient accents as decorative drawn colour rather than photographic shading, an ornamental circular halo or arch behind the main subject, floral arabesque and organic plant motifs woven through the scene, and a decorative botanical border frame around the image, with no letters. Technique reference only; no copy of any specific poster. Principal subjects, identities, actions and relationships follow the current brief, not the reference board. Do not add extra people, deities, animals or a new narrative theme. Ordinary supporting scene details and the source-style ornamental motifs may support the requested scene; when the brief sets an exact count or says only, preserve that restricted inventory. Borrow technique, never the reference scene, props, composition or lettering. Apply the organic floral style around and behind the requested subjects. Muted earthy pastels: sage green, dusty rose, warm cream, ochre, soft teal, dark brown line, small gold accents. If the brief explicitly requests a recolour, retain the same limited colour roles, organic line character and decorative material feel.",
    "hard_constraints": [
      "Keep the style decorative and poster-like: flat soft colour, delicate gradient accents, and drawn ornament rather than photographic shading or realistic lighting.",
      "Use sinuous, organic curves and floral or plant arabesque motifs; avoid geometric Deco stepped forms, harsh metallic gold, neon, and copying a known poster.",
      "Include an ornamental circular halo or arch behind the main subject and a decorative botanical border frame around the image.",
      "No lettering or title panels by default; if the current brief explicitly requires exact words, only those exact words may appear.",
      "Use dark brown contour lines and the muted earthy pastel palette with gold only as small accents.",
      "Do not add subjects, deities, identities, or themes beyond the current brief."
    ],
    "text_mode": [
      "none",
      "native"
    ]
  },
